    "No candidates means analysis finished but no frames met the detection threshold. Lower the detection threshold and filter again, or choose a video with a clearer view of the basket. Candidates below the review threshold are marked “Uncertain”." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No candidates means analysis finished but no frames met the detection threshold. Lower the detection threshold and filter again, or choose a video with a clearer view of the basket. Candidates below the review threshold are marked “Uncertain”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有候选表示分析已完成，但没有画面达到识别阈值。可降低识别阈值重新筛选，或换一段篮筐更清晰的视频。低于复核阈值的候选会标为“待复核”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒有候選表示分析已完成，但沒有畫面達到辨識閾值。可降低辨識閾值重新篩選，或換一段籃框更清晰的影片。低於複核閾值的候選會標為「待確認」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
